Forked from MrShulker 1.4.2 in December 2025. Changes include the rename to Herr Shulker
(mod id "herrshulker", package net.tinkstav.herrshulker), render-state updates for Minecraft
1.21.10 and later, ports to Minecraft 1.21.11, 26.1 and 26.2, a multi-version build, lid-item
rendering on the item form, configuration and command changes, and bug fixes.

